      "description": "Careers | 香港珠海學院 | Hong Kong Chu Hai College Current Students | Staff | Alumni Donation Library 繁體 简体 About Us About the College Vision & Missions Governance Management Structure President's Message Campus & Facilities Map & Directions Administrative College Videos College Publications Admissions About the Admissions Undergraduate Postgraduate Higher Diploma Academics Faculty of Arts and Social Sciences Faculty of Business Faculty of Science and Engineering Ng Teng Fong · Sino Group Belt and Road Research Institute Campus Life HOME Careers Careers Research / Project Positions Administrative Positions Academic Positions Management Positions Currently no job opening for this position About Us Admissions Academics Library Current Students Staff Alumni Copyright © Hong Kong Chu Hai College. All rights reserved. | Address: 80 Castle Peak Road, Castle Peak Bay, Tuen Mun, N.T. Hong Kong. | Tel: (852) 2972 7200 | Fax: (852) 2972 7367 | Email: info@chuhai.edu.hk"
